<p>This site serves static pages. You do not need an account to read them. The hosting provider, Vercel, may process request data to deliver and secure the website. See <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel's privacy policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Newsletter</h2>
{% if integrations.buttondown %}
<p>If you submit the subscription form, your email address is sent to Buttondown to manage your subscription and send email. You can unsubscribe using the link in those emails. See <a href="https://buttondown.com/legal/privacy">Buttondown's privacy policy</a>.</p>
{% else %}<p>Email subscriptions are not currently enabled. The RSS feed requires no signup.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>Comments</h2>
{% if integrations.giscus %}
<p>Comments load only when you select "Load comments." This connects your browser to giscus and GitHub. Posting requires a GitHub account, and comments are publicly stored in GitHub Discussions. See <a href="https://github.com/giscus/giscus/blob/main/PRIVACY-POLICY.md">giscus's privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
{% else %}<p>Comments are not currently enabled, and no comment scripts are loaded.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>Analytics</h2>
{% if integrations.goatcounter %}
<p>This site uses GoatCounter for aggregate traffic measurement. Its script sends visit information to that service; the default service is designed to work without tracking cookies. See <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/privacy">GoatCounter's privacy policy</a>.</p>
{% else %}<p>No analytics script is currently enabled.</p>{% endif %}
<h2>Before launch</h2>
<p>This is a starter disclosure, not legal advice. The site owner needs to add a contact method and review this page against their actual configuration and applicable requirements before launch.</p>
